  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Erection of part single storey front extension, part single part two storey side to rear extension and erection of detached outbuilding",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;PT Sans&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The proposed alterations, specifically the\r\nchange in height and form of the roof, by reason of its uncharacteristic design,\r\nwould unbalance the pair of semi-detached properties and result in an incongruous\r\nform of development which would fail to respect the character, composition and\r\ndesign of the host dwellinghouse and neighbouring properties. The proposal\r\nwould therefore result in a detrimental impact to the character and appearance\r\nof the subject dwellinghouse and the character of the surrounding area,\r\ncontrary to the high quality design aspirations of National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2024), Policy D3 (D.1, D.11 and D.12) of the London Plan (2021), Policy\r\nGR1 of the Local Plan (2021 – 2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning\r\nDocument: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
